00:12:44,675 --> 00:12:46,315
里面的示巴女王是
And Sheba was...

352
00:12:46,345 --> 00:12:47,865
-吉娜·劳洛勃丽吉达 -答对了
- Gina Lollobrigida! - Bingo!

353
00:12:47,915 --> 00:12:49,545
我发誓 我这一辈子总有一天
And for the rest of my life, I swore, one day,

354
00:12:49,585 --> 00:12:51,475
我要和吉娜·劳洛勃丽吉达结婚
I would marry Gina Lollobrigida.

355
00:12:51,640 --> 00:12:52,800
老爸 你差不多算是做到了
Well, dad, you kind of did.

356
00:12:52,920 --> 00:12:53,700
我知道
I hear that!

357
00:12:55,305 --> 00:12:57,405
这很不错 里面有什么
Mmm. These are good. What's in them?

358
00:12:57,425 --> 00:12:59,375
玛格丽特加苦艾酒
It's a Margarita with a shot of absinthe.

359
00:12:59,640 --> 00:13:01,320
苦艾酒可以加深感情
Absinthe makes the heart grow fonder.

360
00:13:01,485 --> 00:13:04,055
你是在说双关语还是口齿不清啊
Ohh, are you making a bad pun or just lisping?

361
00:13:04,260 --> 00:13:06,380
真不敢相信 我白开这么长的路
I can't believe I drove all the way to the valley

362
00:13:06,380 --> 00:13:07,280
到山谷里去接你
to pick you up.

363
00:13:08,640 --> 00:13:09,840
贾斯汀 加酒
Justin, more booze!

364
00:13:13,515 --> 00:13:15,995
海莉 一切都还好吗
Haley, hi. Is -- is everything okay?

365
00:13:15,995 --> 00:13:16,975
是的 怎么了
Yeah, why?

366
00:13:16,975 --> 00:13:19,515
我刚看见一个男人走过客厅
Because I just saw a man walk through the living room.

367
00:13:19,760 --> 00:13:21,300
什么 你在哪
What? Where are you?

368
00:13:21,540 --> 00:13:23,840
我可以通过电脑上的摄像头看到
I can see through the camera on the computer.

369
00:13:24,180 --> 00:13:26,140
你竟然监视我 天啊
You're spying on me? Oh, my god.

370
00:13:26,140 --> 00:13:28,140
天啊 这也太逊了吧
Oh, my god. That is so lame.

371
00:13:28,700 --> 00:13:30,760
我不知道你看到了什么
Look, I don't know what you think you saw

372
00:13:30,820 --> 00:13:32,920
或许是电视 或许是反射的影像
Maybe the TV, or the reflection,

373
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:34,980
或许你觉得我的身材看起来像男孩
or maybe you think that my body's just shaped like a boy,

374
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:36,180
就像我没有臀部什么的
like I don't have hips or something.

375
00:13:36,415 --> 00:13:39,025
不 你的身材好极了
No, no, no, no. You have a-a darling figure.

376
00:13:39,025 --> 00:13:40,925
我只是担心
I was just concerned that

377
00:13:41,120 --> 00:13:42,640
太伤人了
That hurts so much.

378
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:45,200
这种事情我以为只有我老妈会做
This is the kind of thing that I expect from my mother,

379
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:46,820
没想到我这么酷的叔叔也这么干
but not from my cool uncle,

380
00:13:46,880 --> 00:13:49,200
谢谢你这样的信任
so thank you for all of your trust.

381
00:13:49,495 --> 00:13:51,785
好了 对不起
Okay, I'm -- sorry. Sorry.

382
00:13:53,600 --> 00:13:53,920
难以置信
Unbelievable.

383
00:13:54,605 --> 00:13:56,195
你得走了
You got to go.

384
00:13:57,380 --> 00:13:57,760
好吧
Okay.

385
00:14:09,295 --> 00:14:10,895
好
Yeah. All right.

386
00:14:11,235 --> 00:14:13,275
谢谢
Thank you. Thank you.

387
00:14:13,305 --> 00:14:15,805
爸爸 我从来没听过你唱歌
Dad, I've never seen you sing before.

388
00:14:15,845 --> 00:14:17,245
那是因为你没看过我洗澡
Well, you never saw me in the shower.

389
00:14:17,275 --> 00:14:18,645
我可没要邀请你们跟我一起洗啊
And don't anybody go there.

390
00:14:20,145 --> 00:14:21,615
我十二岁那年
When I was 12 years old,

391
00:14:21,615 --> 00:14:24,465
我爸走进我的房间 逮到我在做
My father walked into my bedroom and caught me doing

392
00:14:24,465 --> 00:14:27,605
一个男生所能做出的最丢脸的事
the most embarrassing thing that a boy can do --

393
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:30,100
在跳麦当娜的《幸运星》
Dancing to Madonna's "Lucky star."

394
00:14:30,680 --> 00:14:32,820
从那一刻开始
And from that moment on,

395
00:14:33,180 --> 00:14:35,400
我就开始对他隐藏我内心的某一部分
There's always been a part of me that I've kept from him.

396
00:14:35,520 --> 00:14:36,760
然而 现在的他
And yet, yeah, here he was,

397
00:14:36,760 --> 00:14:38,520
在跟我的朋友谈笑风声
You know, laughing with my friends.

398
00:14:39,500 --> 00:14:41,000
我说不准
And...I don't know.

399
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:42,600
也许问题出在我
Maybe the problem was me.

400
00:14:45,500 --> 00:14:46,180
罗伯·劳
Rob Lowe.

401
00:14:46,396 --> 00:14:47,396
-在哪 -在哪 -在哪 -在哪
- Where? - Where? - Where? - Where?

402
00:14:47,426 --> 00:14:48,896
不不 《七个毕业生》中的罗伯·劳
No, no, Rob Lowe from "St. Elmo's fire."

403
00:14:48,926 --> 00:14:51,546
这是我以前的来电对象 我爱他
That was -- that was my crush. I loved him.

404
00:14:51,546 --> 00:14:53,196
我了解 他当时可是个帅小伙
I get that. He was a good-looking kid.

405
00:14:53,760 --> 00:14:55,100
-当真 -当然
- Right? - Yeah.

406
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,900
《行如男子汉》
Hey, "Walk like a man"?

407
00:14:56,900 --> 00:14:59,940
我会唱 但我走起路来可不像男子汉
Well, I can sing it, but I can't do it.

408
00:15:04,026 --> 00:15:05,856
我刚刚似乎把什么弄伤了
I think I just broken somthing.

409
00:15:05,856 --> 00:15:08,236
-痛 -护士
- Ow! - Nurse!

410
00:15:16,780 --> 00:15:17,260
喂
Hello?

411
00:15:17,680 --> 00:15:19,320
求您告诉我我的鞋在你那
Please tell me that you have my shoes.

412
00:15:19,580 --> 00:15:20,840
为什么你的鞋在我这
Why would I have your shoes?

413
00:15:21,046 --> 00:15:23,366
因为我昨晚把他们留在你舅舅家了
Because I left them at your uncles's house last night.

414
00:15:23,900 --> 00:15:26,140
什么 你怎么没穿鞋就走了
What? How could you leave without your shoes?

415
00:15:26,140 --> 00:15:28,380
我经常不穿鞋子到处走
I go a lot of places without shoes.

416
00:15:28,860 --> 00:15:30,460
我现在就没有穿
I'm not wearing shoes right now.

417
00:15:30,720 --> 00:15:31,880
不 等等
Oh, wait.

418
00:15:31,896 --> 00:15:34,386
那是因为我把它们落在你舅舅家了
That's 'cause I left them at your uncles's house.

419
00:15:34,440 --> 00:15:36,040
这可惨了
This is a disaster!

420
00:15:36,776 --> 00:15:38,556
也许他们会以为那双鞋是他们自己的
Well, maybe they'll think they're theirs.

421
00:15:38,620 --> 00:15:40,500
他们是同志 他们对他们的鞋了如指掌
They're gay. They know what shoes they own.

422
00:15:43,620 --> 00:15:44,760
多谢 沃特
Thanks a lot, Walt.

423
00:15:44,980 --> 00:15:47,200
你就不能对我父母友善一次吗
You couldn't be nice to my parents for two seconds,

424
00:15:47,200 --> 00:15:49,200
弄得现在我被禁止跟你玩了
so now I'm not allowed to hang out with you.

425
00:15:49,460 --> 00:15:50,640
你要我怎么样
What do you want from me?

426
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:52,160
我以为你是我朋友
I thought you were my friend.

427
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:54,580
你答应过我教我怎么种番茄
You promised to teach me how to grow tomatoes,

428
00:15:54,716 --> 00:15:56,666
还有带我去喝蛋奶乳的
and you were gonna take me for an egg cream.

429
00:15:56,860 --> 00:15:58,820
算了吧 你就一小屁孩
Forget it. You're a little kid.

430
00:15:59,200 --> 00:16:00,540
你别跟我用激将法
I don't need the aggravation.

431
00:16:01,060 --> 00:16:03,520
这样 对不起我"激怒"你了
Oh, sorry I "Aggravated" You.

432
00:16:03,800 --> 00:16:06,580
随便告诉一下 一堆人觉得我可爱死了
And, just so you know, a lot of people think I'm adorable.

433
00:16:15,100 --> 00:16:16,340
我打不开
I can't open this.

434
00:16:16,520 --> 00:16:18,660
也许你去音乐会就不用
Maybe if you had gone to the concert instead --

435
00:16:19,380 --> 00:16:20,760
你帮我打开好吗
Could you open it, please?

436
00:16:20,880 --> 00:16:22,960
我可以 但我年纪已经大到知道
I would, but I'm old enough to know

437
00:16:22,960 --> 00:16:25,260
我不喜欢打开阿司匹林瓶子
that I don't like opening aspirin bottles.

438
00:16:27,940 --> 00:16:28,420
喂
Hello?

439
00:16:28,920 --> 00:16:30,880
-爸 -你们是怎么做到了
- Hey, Dad! - How do you guys do it?

440
00:16:31,040 --> 00:16:32,500
我醉得叫警察跟我一起喝
I thought cops could drink.

441
00:16:33,686 --> 00:16:35,446
我只是 我想告诉你说
Listen, I just -- I wanted to say

442
00:16:35,446 --> 00:16:37,206
我昨晚和你玩得很开心
I had such a good time with you last night,

443
00:16:37,216 --> 00:16:39,656
-我想要 -等下 我有电话进来
- and I wanted to -- -hey, hold on. I got call waiting. Yeah.

444
00:16:40,920 --> 00:16:41,400
喂
Yeah?

445
00:16:42,280 --> 00:16:45,060
看来不爱早起 了解了
Woof, not a morning person. Good to know.

446
00:16:45,340 --> 00:16:46,540
我还有五公里就到
Listen, I'm five away.

447
00:16:46,680 --> 00:16:49,080
但愿你喜欢蓝莓烤饼和达斯汀·斯普林菲尔德
I hope you like Blueberry Scones and Dusty Springfield.

448
00:16:49,346 --> 00:16:51,336
-你是哪位 -胡焦 小傻帽
- Who is this? - Pepper, silly.

449
00:16:51,380 --> 00:16:53,680
今天的沙漠那估计热翻天
It's gonna be a scorcher in the desert today,

450
00:16:53,680 --> 00:16:54,640
相应地少穿点
So dress accordingly.

451
00:16:55,500 --> 00:16:57,380
到你家那条街了 待会见
Oh, this is your street. See you in a minute.

452
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:00,800
这下麻烦大了
Holy crap!

453
00:17:00,800 --> 00:17:02,080
你那个朋友 叫胡焦那个
That friend of yours, that Pepper.

454
00:17:02,460 --> 00:17:03,820
他正在来我家的路上 为什么
He's on his way over here. Why?

455
00:17:04,160 --> 00:17:06,140
昨晚你跟他约好的 你不记得了
Well, you made a date with him last night. Don't you remember?

456
00:17:06,260 --> 00:17:08,600
如果我跟个男人有约 我肯定我记得
I think I would remember if I made a date with a guy!

457
00:17:08,920 --> 00:17:10,880
我跟你讲 我认识棕榈泉的一个家伙
I'm telling you, I know a guy in Palm Springs

458
00:17:10,880 --> 00:17:13,540
他有人类所知的所有年份的古董唱片
Who has every single Vintage record known to man.

459
00:17:13,680 --> 00:17:16,120
我明天开车过去 一起去吧
I'm driving out there tomorrow. Come with me.

460
00:17:16,120 --> 00:17:16,960
这可是个约会
It's a date!

461
00:17:17,097 --> 00:17:18,467
是的
All right!

462
00:17:19,920 --> 00:17:20,900
我当时醉了
I was drunk.

463
00:17:21,100 --> 00:17:23,640
我可不要跟沙漠女王普里西拉去购物
I'm not going shopping with Priscilla, queen of the desert.

464
00:17:24,100 --> 00:17:24,600
好的 爸
Okay, Dad.

465
00:17:24,740 --> 00:17:26,580
我对我们目前的关系很满意
Well, I'm feeling really good about our relationship,

466
00:17:26,580 --> 00:17:28,660
而我也想要保持这种状态更长久一些
and I want to hold on to that for a little while longer,

467
00:17:28,700 --> 00:17:30,120
所以我现在要行动了 再聊 挂了
so I'm gonna go ahead and hang up with you.

468
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:31,680
替我大大地亲下胡焦
Give pepper a big kiss for me.

469
00:17:35,520 --> 00:17:36,240
歌洛莉亚 现在听我说
Gloria, now, listen.

470
00:17:36,240 --> 00:17:38,520
我知道音乐会那事让你很不爽
I know that you're upset with me about that concert thing,

471
00:17:38,520 --> 00:17:41,140
你有权这样 但现在你要帮我
And rightfully so, but you have to help me.

472
00:17:41,280 --> 00:17:41,900
怎么办
What is it?

473
00:17:41,957 --> 00:17:44,727
似乎我跟米奇尔的朋友胡焦有约
It seems I made plans with Mitchell's friend Pepper.

474
00:17:44,727 --> 00:17:46,157
这是个人名吗 叫胡椒
That's someone's name? Pepper?

475
00:17:46,260 --> 00:17:48,020
是的 这只是冰山一角
Yes, and that's just the tip of the iceberg.

476
00:17:48,020 --> 00:17:49,440
还有个家伙叫朗吉奴斯[圣徒]
There's another guy named Longinus.

477
00:17:49,980 --> 00:17:51,260
但胡焦这会就回到我们家
But Pepper's gonna be here any second.

478
00:17:51,320 --> 00:17:52,760
他要带我去棕榈泉
He's gonna take me to Palm Springs

479
00:17:52,760 --> 00:17:54,500
去买唱片
To go shopping for records.

480
00:17:54,660 --> 00:17:55,960
待会他到我们这
Now, when he gets here,

481
00:17:56,060 --> 00:17:58,060
你可不可以假装我们这有急事要处理
Can you pretend there's some kind of an emergency?

482
00:17:58,280 --> 00:17:59,420
可以吗 求你了
Can you do that, please?

483
00:17:59,707 --> 00:18:01,527
疼 杰
Iay, Jay!

484
00:18:01,527 --> 00:18:04,057
恐怕你得赶紧送我去医院
I-I think you'll have to take me now to the hospital.

485
00:18:04,300 --> 00:18:06,080
我现在头痛欲裂
My head is in pain.

486
00:18:07,280 --> 00:18:09,560
-你是说像这样吧 -正是 多谢
- Do you mean like that? - Yes, thank you.

487
00:18:10,320 --> 00:18:11,480
好嘞 好戏登场了
Okay, it's showtime.

488
00:18:11,520 --> 00:18:13,160
这种语境下 这话就是指演戏
And with this guy, I mean that literally.

489
00:18:16,280 --> 00:18:17,320
我来也
I'm here!

490
00:18:18,320 --> 00:18:19,480
我的神呐
Oh, my god.

491
00:18:19,680 --> 00:18:21,580
你们这个家真是无可挑剔
What I could do with this house.

492
00:18:21,740 --> 00:18:22,660
你好啊 杰
Hello, Jay.

493
00:18:24,660 --> 00:18:26,020
抓紧时间 这一趟车程有两小时呢
Chop, chop -- it's a two-hour drive,

494
00:18:26,080 --> 00:18:27,680
还不算上折扣商场那一站
Not counting our stop at the outlet mall.

495
00:18:27,707 --> 00:18:30,307
好吧 歌洛莉亚 我们要走了
Oh, okay. Um, Gloria, we're leaving!

496
00:18:31,060 --> 00:18:33,120
你好 您就是胡焦吧
Hello. You must be Pepper.

497
00:18:33,277 --> 00:18:34,327
哎哟喂
Ay, ay, ay.

498
00:18:34,327 --> 00:18:35,947
-我的头啊 -你没事吧 歌洛莉亚
- My head. - What's the matter, Gloria?

499
00:18:35,947 --> 00:18:37,397
哦 没事
Oh, nothing.

500
00:18:37,447 --> 00:18:39,847
刚吃点冰淇淋
I just had a little ice cream. Huh?

501
00:18:40,120 --> 00:18:42,620
他一天到晚喋喋不休 都在讲你
He hasn't stopped talking about you all day long.

502
00:18:44,120 --> 00:18:45,740
嫂夫人真是魅力摄人
You are stunning.

503
00:18:46,220 --> 00:18:47,780
有妻如此 夫复何求
How rich are you?

504
00:18:47,980 --> 00:18:49,500
你真的没事吗 歌洛莉亚
Are you sure you're all right, gloria?

505
00:18:49,500 --> 00:18:51,000
我好着呢 [西语]亲爱的
I feel great, mi amor.

506
00:18:51,527 --> 00:18:53,247
他能和你出去我真开心
I am so happy that he's doing this with you,

507
00:18:53,297 --> 00:18:55,727
因为任我想方设法 他还是顽固不化
because I never get him to do anything different,

508
00:18:55,767 --> 00:18:58,197
听一场维瓦尔第都不肯
Like the Vivaldi, hmm?

509
00:18:58,237 --> 00:19:00,837
比起我来 他好像更喜欢你哦
I think he likes you more than me.

510
00:19:01,020 --> 00:19:02,580
你们两个玩得开心点
You two have a great time together.

511
00:19:02,580 --> 00:19:03,860
好吧 但我们得早点回来
All right, but we got to be back early,

512
00:19:03,860 --> 00:19:05,060
我还有事要做 你懂的
Because, you know, I got that work thing.

513
00:19:05,380 --> 00:19:08,180
那些事我都推掉了 没什么要你忙的
No, no, I canceled everything. You don't have anything.

514
00:19:08,180 --> 00:19:10,460
你可以和他玩上一整天
You can spend all day long with him.

515
00:19:10,760 --> 00:19:12,980
太棒了 那咱出发吧
Wonderful. Well, shall we?

516
00:19:16,180 --> 00:19:18,920
天啊 塔卢拉
Oh, my god. Tallulah! Oh!

517
00:19:18,920 --> 00:19:21,660
别担心 等你一抱她 就不叫了
Don't worry. She'll stop yapping when she gets on your lap.

518
00:19:27,537 --> 00:19:30,268
艾丽克斯 快点 就要迟到了
Alex, honey, come on. We're gonna be late.

519
00:19:31,418 --> 00:19:33,608
近期有一群牛无故倒毙
A herd of cows dropped dead for no reason.

520
00:19:33,740 --> 00:19:34,800
地球很危险 我哪也不去
I'm not going anywhere.

521
00:19:35,120 --> 00:19:36,340
觉醒吧 无知愚民
Get your affairs in order, people.

522
00:19:36,340 --> 00:19:37,220
世界末日来了
This is the end.

523
00:19:37,500 --> 00:19:38,360
别逗了
Don't be ridiculous.

524
00:19:38,360 --> 00:19:41,020
外面才没什么好怕的呢
There's nothing out there to be afraid of.

525
00:19:42,348 --> 00:19:43,338
克里扎克先生
Mr. Kleezak.

526
00:19:43,338 --> 00:19:46,338
我可不习惯被人捅醒
I'm not used to waking up with people poking me.

527
00:19:46,580 --> 00:19:48,100
可把我吓坏了
I was startled, you know.

528
00:19:48,300 --> 00:19:49,660
那件事真不好意思
We're really sorry about that.

529
00:19:49,940 --> 00:19:50,840
那什么...
Yeah, well...

530
00:19:50,840 --> 00:19:53,760
这是我自己种的洋葱
These are onions from my garden.

531
00:19:53,860 --> 00:19:55,600
哇 太谢谢您了
Wow. Thank you so much.

532
00:19:56,260 --> 00:19:57,700
您人真好
That is so nice.

533
00:19:58,078 --> 00:19:59,828
这些溢美之辞还是省省吧
Yeah, well, don't go throwing any parades.

534
00:20:00,120 --> 00:20:00,700
不就是洋葱吗
They're onions.

535
00:20:05,988 --> 00:20:08,258
我以前当过消防员
I used to be a fireman, you know.

536
00:20:08,600 --> 00:20:11,060
我从不伤害孩子
I don't hurt kids.

537
00:20:13,480 --> 00:20:14,620
您要进来坐吗
Sir, would you like to come in?

538
00:20:16,598 --> 00:20:20,218
跟孩子说一声 今天三点开播《原野奇侠》
Just tell the boy that "Shane" is on today at 3:00.

539
00:20:20,248 --> 00:20:21,248
他该看看
He should watch it.

540
00:20:21,298 --> 00:20:22,918
您不妨亲自告诉他
Maybe you could tell him yourself.

541
00:20:22,968 --> 00:20:24,258
他就在楼上 等一下啊
He's -- he's right upstairs. Hang on.

542
00:20:24,308 --> 00:20:25,308
卢克 宝贝 快下来
Luke, honey, come on down!

543
00:20:25,338 --> 00:20:27,638
你的朋友 沃特来了
Your friend...Walt is here.

544
00:20:27,678 --> 00:20:30,538
-您真的太好了 -是啊
- This is just so sweet. - Yeah.

545
00:20:30,558 --> 00:20:32,208
只要你别跳舞 什么都好说
Well, just don't start dancing.

546
00:20:32,240 --> 00:20:33,500
人们总会出乎你的意料
People can surprise you.

547
00:20:33,880 --> 00:20:37,400
你为表象所蒙蔽 看惯了他们人前的一面
You get used to thinking of them one way, stuck in their roles.

548
00:20:38,040 --> 00:20:39,200
以为眼见为实
They are what they are.

549
00:20:39,448 --> 00:20:40,228
我年轻那会...
I was young at the time...

550
00:20:40,228 --> 00:20:42,738
这时他们就会出其不意
And then they do something that shows you

551
00:20:42,778 --> 00:20:45,078
展示出自己深藏不露
there's all this depth and dimension

552
00:20:45,108 --> 00:20:47,278
不为你所知的复杂内心
that you never knew existed.

553
00:20:47,328 --> 00:20:48,948
你是在说罗伯·劳吗
Are you talking about Rob Lowe?

554
00:20:48,998 --> 00:20:51,118
我只是说他是演艺界全才
I'm just saying he's a very versatile actor.

555
00:20:51,168 --> 00:20:53,588
我觉得英俊长相实际上限制了他的发展
I think his good looks have actually held him back.

556
00:20:53,618 --> 00:20:55,548
这点我同意
Well, I can relate to that.

557
00:21:00,780 --> 00:21:02,620
-海莉 -我们得谈谈
- Haley! - We need to talk.

558
00:21:02,860 --> 00:21:04,440
我知道昨晚的事把你们吓得不轻
I know I freaked out on you last night,

559
00:21:04,440 --> 00:21:06,420
但你们也得站在我的角度想想啊
but you have to see it from my point of view.

560
00:21:06,540 --> 00:21:08,800
-你们一直在监视我 -没错
- You were totally spying on me. - I know.

561
00:21:08,900 --> 00:21:11,600
你侵犯了第一修正案赋予我的隐私权
You were invading my first-amendment right to privacy.

562
00:21:11,880 --> 00:21:12,060
正是
We were.

563
00:21:12,100 --> 00:21:14,780
我受够了别人的猜疑
I'm sick and tired of people not trusting me.

564
00:21:14,800 --> 00:21:16,840
-我理解 -尤其是你们
- I get it. - And especially you guys.

565
00:21:16,880 --> 00:21:18,520
我没把你们当老派长辈
I don't think of you guys as my uncles,

566
00:21:18,600 --> 00:21:19,980
我一直当你们是知心朋友
I think of you as my friends.

567
00:21:20,020 --> 00:21:21,640
要是连朋友的信任都失去了
And if your friends don't believe in you,

568
00:21:21,720 --> 00:21:22,900
你还能留下些什么
then what else do you have?

569
00:21:23,160 --> 00:21:23,880
迪兰的鞋子算不算
Dylan's shoes?

570
00:21:24,060 --> 00:21:25,460
千万别告诉我妈
Please don't tell my mom.

571
00:21:27,400 --> 00:21:28,040
开车回去记得系安全带哦
Buckle up.
